                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.00/883: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Earle</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-28T14:00:00+01:00">February 28, 1934—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 28—9:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. My telegram No. 37 of today. Proposed statement has full approval Austrian
                    Foreign Office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Earle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
